          "source": "https://www.loc.gov/preservation/digital/formats/fdd/fdd000063.shtml"
        },
        {
          "fact": "MJPEG is a video encoding, rather than a single audio/video container.",
          "source": "https://www.loc.gov/preservation/digital/formats/fdd/fdd000063.shtml"
        },
        {
          "fact": "OpenDML documents an MJPEG profile for the AVI wrapper.",
          "source": "https://www.loc.gov/preservation/digital/formats/fdd/fdd000063.shtml"
        },
        {
          "fact": "OpenDML’s AVI extensions were developed during 1996–1997.",
          "source": "https://www.loc.gov/preservation/digital/formats/fdd/fdd000063.shtml"
        },
        {
          "fact": "AVI files containing this encoding commonly identify it with the MJPG FourCC.",
          "source": "https://www.loc.gov/preservation/digital/formats/fdd/fdd000063.shtml"
        },
        {
          "fact": "QuickTime is another wrapper used for MJPEG.",
